        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "This park is amazing, so many things to do in the summer and winter!! Tennis, basketball, workout area, hockey rink, volleyball, park for kids, water park, soccer nets, ice rinks in the winter.",
