        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing local park with great activities for the kids! Typical jungle-gym, then there is a water park, street hockey rink, tennis courts, and to top it off an obstacle course!  The city did an awesome job thinking up and bringing the park to reality!!",
